{"version":1,"key":"card:25","content":{"id":25,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6353881b-4b47-4dac-93db-656390c4fa4e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量声明，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"let"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明类型，默认是不可变的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Rust","uuid":"b83483ec-6d8b-4db9-8678-75a44cdd1743","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d3a6cf1c-1aba-4adb-8feb-2e866c8b9cef","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let a = 1;\n// 不能重新赋值\na = 2;","collabId":"35dd526b-8bbb-4f12-a29a-e5e4c6f3c0b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"791175e4-a11d-4916-a546-54df119a2c32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要使得变量可变，应当在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"let"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后加上 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"mut"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rust","uuid":"9c76dbbe-0e3a-42df-9ff9-2d93c25d4c12","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"15ddce94-c3da-4011-a1b2-4d6247421dda","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let mut a = 1;\na = 2;","collabId":"724933d7-d1ef-426b-ae31-9803c886ca9a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"98b8ac55-c2ca-461b-a4a9-ab0edf8a71e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"let"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明变量后，后续可以继续声明，后续的声明会覆盖前面的声明（这个行为称为隐藏 shadow）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"df2784f4-266e-4bf0-9609-451da2d8458b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相比于可变变量，重新声明变量的类型可以与之前不同"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rust","uuid":"266d98cc-ae03-458e-8af5-1923fc8c6f19","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3da044c0-2616-4270-8e22-5896c0ae72f8","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let guess = \"2\";\nlet guess: u32 = guess.parse().unwrap();","collabId":"6476cbe3-dda2-4280-9df9-975f7d1af82f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"12442c68-2e02-4d33-af97-2a312d4adf8b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"829028fd-652a-4bf3-a524-b704a6be97d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"建议只有在类型不同但不想重新想一个变量名的时候，才重新声明变量，如果变量类型相同，你没注意到前面已经声明过了，你又声明了一个同名的变量，但是含义和值与之前的不同，这种情况下，在语法上是不会报错的，但是在逻辑上可能存在问题，因为这个变量的含义变了，但却是以之前的含义使用的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cb9e9e87-dca9-4ad3-b9c8-a760f74ce685","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果变量类型相同，可以直接将变量声明为可变的，后面直接赋值就行了，至少赋值的时候你会知道之前声明过，以及它的含义是什么，不会突然改变它的含义，从而产生隐形的逻辑错误。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a51661ba-9290-4eea-a082-45fee70f5af5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"const"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以声明常量，常量的变量名我们一般全用大写字母，单词之前使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"_"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 分割，常量它也是不可变的，并且始终是不可变的，相比于不可变变量，还有几点不同"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"81966cef-87d7-4cfe-8795-73fd1e077d48","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e2731126-e0e8-4c16-b792-52e648f9d21b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"71cdb8fb-bc71-46b7-bc09-ee33852c6768","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不能使用变量为其赋值，必须使用字面值，因为必须在编译的时候就得确定它的值"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b02bc6bd-6872-4357-8d64-66347bd1a172","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f99409da-1233-401e-9bcc-dc4848a3d755","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其生命周期与程序的生命周期相同，作用域遍布整个程序，不论你声明在哪里"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2d728567-9480-4291-8986-160951d43758","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e92979bf-8bc9-498e-914a-91fe910bb63f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常量需要声明类型，不可变变量可以通过用法推断其类型"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rust","uuid":"d22f74b5-05d8-493d-b0ed-a26173508b32","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ca78968e-877e-4bf7-b9b5-ddb518321eef","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const LIGHT_SPEED: u32 = 300000000;","collabId":"4f217b63-0e54-43ae-b632-fac2d07bf410","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Rust/语法/变量声明"],"createTime":1688952373667,"updateTime":1744419665243,"linkedCards":[]},"meta